  "description": "Golden vectors for OID4VP transaction_data (EC TS12 payment SCA). `raw` is the base64url string a verifier puts in the request; `json` is what it decodes to. `hashes` are base64url(HASH(ASCII bytes of raw)) per OID4VP 1.0 Appendix B ('base64url decoding is not performed before hashing'), computed with Python hashlib, independent of any wallet or verifier code. Every consumer (backend, vc, wallet-common, Kotlin, Swift) should check the same file. Regenerate only deliberately: the values are a contract.",
